class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white\">Company</h3><nav class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3\"><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[#c5a059]\" href=\"#about\">About</a><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[#c5a059]\" href=\"#insights\">Insights</a><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[#c5a059]\" href=\"#contact\">Contact</a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[#c5a059]\" href=\"#\">Careers<span class=\"rounded-full border border-ssl-gold/20 bg-ssl-gold/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-ssl-gold\">Hiring</span></a></nav></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white\">Legal</h3><nav class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3\"><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[#c5a059]\" href=\"#\">Privacy Policy</a><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[#c5a059]\" href=\"#\">Terms of Service</a><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[#c5a059]\" href=\"#\">Cookie Policy</a></nav></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 border-t border-white/[0.06] pt-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500/80 sm:flex-row\"><p>© 2022–2026 Signal Strait Labs. All rights reserved.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-3 w-3 text-[#c5a059]/60\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><span>Nairobi, Kenya</span></div></div></div></div></footer></div><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3s6nzrbk-8mnv.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><div hidden id=\"S:0\"><main class=\"bg-ssl-light-bg py-24 sm:py-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6\"><div style=\"animation-timeline:view();animation-range:entry 0% cover 35%;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-name:slide-up-in;animation-duration:1s;animation-timing-function:ease-out\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center items-center mb-16\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-500\">Our Story</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl text-ssl-bg\">Engineered for Performance</h2><p class=\"text-base text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Founded in Nairobi in 2022, Signal Strait Labs was built to bridge the gap between high-end digital infrastructure and the unique requirements of rapidly growing enterprises.</p></div></div><div class=\"space-y-12\"><div style=\"animation-delay:0.1s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"glass-card-light rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12\"><h3 class=\"mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\">The Context</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">In 2022, we observed a persistent disconnect: enterprises in emerging markets were often forced to choose between local agility and global-standard technical architecture. We started Signal Strait Labs to provide both. We combine the precision of modern Jamstack architecture with strategic growth engineering to ensure our partners operate at global speed.</p></div></div><div style=\"animation-delay:0.2s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"glass-card-dark rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12\"><h3 class=\"mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-white\">Our Mission</h3><p class=\"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\">To transform organizational growth through clean, performant digital infrastructure. We exist to eliminate the friction between your technical stack and your revenue goals. We don&#x27;t just build sites; we build institutional authority, automated data pipelines, and optimized search footprints that drive measurable business value.</p></div></div><div style=\"animation-delay:0.3s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"glass-card-light rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12\"><h3 class=\"mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Nairobi, 2022</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">Based in Thome, Nairobi, we operate at the intersection of local insight and international quality. Our location is more than just a home—it&#x27;s the front line for the next generation of digital transformation. We work with clients who understand that the future of business is built on code that is as resilient as it is fast.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-24\"><div style=\"animation-timeline:view();animation-range:entry 0% cover 35%;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-name:slide-up-in;animation-duration:1s;animation-timing-function:ease-out\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center items-center mb-16\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-500\">The People</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl text-ssl-bg\">Our Team</h2><p class=\"text-base text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">The people building Signal Strait Labs.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div style=\"animation-delay:0.1s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 h-full\"><div class=\"glass-card-light flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 text-center h-full rounded-2xl\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ssl-bg text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-gold\">F</div><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Founder</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1 italic\">Pending bio</p></div></div><div style=\"animation-delay:0.2s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 h-full\"><div class=\"glass-card-light flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 text-center h-full rounded-2xl\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ssl-bg text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-gold\">L</div><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Lead Engineer</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1 italic\">Pending bio</p></div></div><div style=\"animation-delay:0.30000000000000004s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 h-full\"><div class=\"glass-card-light flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 text-center h-full rounded-2xl\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ssl-bg text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-gold\">G</div><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Growth Strategist</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1 italic\">Pending bio</p></div></div><div style=\"animation-delay:0.4s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 h-full\"><div class=\"glass-card-light flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 text-center h-full rounded-2xl\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ssl-bg text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-gold\">D</div><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Design Lead</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1 italic\">Pending bio</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-24\"><div style=\"animation-timeline:view();animation-range:entry 0% cover 35%;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-name:slide-up-in;animation-duration:1s;animation-timing-function:ease-out\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center items-center mb-16\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-500\">Contact</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl text-ssl-bg\">Where We Work</h2><p class=\"text-base text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Based in Nairobi, working with clients everywhere.</p></div></div><div style=\"animation-timeline:view();animation-range:entry 0% cover 35%;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-name:slide-up-in;animation-duration:1s;animation-timing-function:ease-out\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"glass-card-light overflow-hidden rounded-2xl p-4 md:p-6\"><div class=\"mb-6 h-96 w-full o